{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22942","headline":"元十八从事南海欲出庐山临别旧居有恋泉声之什因以投和兼伸别情 · 白居易","name":"元十八从事南海欲出庐山临别旧居有恋泉声之什因以投和兼伸别情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤侯辟士礼从容，莫恋泉声问所从。\n雨露初承黄纸诏，烟霞欲别紫霄峰。\n伤弓未息新惊鸟，得水难留久卧龙。\n我正退藏君变化，一杯可易得相逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}